abstract: >-
  An evolving research archive documenting the development of laser microplasma
  processing of transparent dielectric materials, from early glass-carbon
  experiments and porous-glass passivation to controlled fused-silica surface
  relief and functional micro-optical elements. Peer-reviewed papers remain the
  authoritative source for published results; these notes add chronology,
  experimental context, numerical ranges, retrospective interpretation and links
  between stages of the research.
